ary run via persist_artifacts(), and panics on any failure. Test output shows trace paths for all 8 summary runs.","AC4 (directional/envelope assertions): Confirmed — all probes use directional comparisons (<, >, >=, <=) and Envelope ranges (pH 6.8-8.6, temp 23-26.5, etc.). No exact count assertions.","AC5 (breeding 1000+ hours with 2+ cycles): Confirmed — 60 days x 24h = 1440 hours, complete_cycle_count >= 2 assertion at line 294. Test output shows cycles=10, berried_days=18, hatch_days=10, population 10->260.","Clippy reports zero warnings on e2e_shrimp_scenario_probes.rs (pre-existing warnings in e2e_validation_suite.rs are outside this deliverable).","Tracing tests: all 23 pass including trace_verbosity_reports_tick_snapshot_for_shrimp_probe_debugging.","Thermal suppression probe now has positive breeding control (lines 649-659): asserts cool arm produces hatch evidence or offspring, preventing regressions where both arms fail to breed. Cool arm finishes with cond=0.926, molt_stress=0.009, 218 juveniles, 9 hatch events — a genuine healthy baseline.","Summary runner persists structured trace artifacts unconditionally for summary runs (lines 71-78 in finish_probe), with deterministic file paths reported in the summary output.","Chemistry stress probe seeds adults at end of intermolt cycle (lines 775-779) and asserts either MoltFailure events or lingering failed_molt_accum (lines 864-873). Test output confirms molt_failures=1, failed_molt_accum=0.300.","Chloride protection uses real branched runs: 3-day pre-treatment crisis, then state cloned into salt-treated (200 mg/L Cl) and matched-control branches with 50% water changes, 3-day recovery. Test output: treated_deaths=0 < control_deaths=3, treated_hazard=0.3518 < control_hazard=4.3736."],"findings_or_gaps":["Pre-existing clippy warnings in e2e_validation_suite.rs (redundant closures) are outside this deliverable's scope but should be cleaned up separately.","The breeding_success_state fixture sets DOC=5.0 and DON=0.8 as absolute totals without `* vol`, unlike every other non-zero water parameter in the function. This is confirmed as intentional (matches reproduction_factors.rs:34-36 with explicit comment about avoiding mineralization-driven ammonia spikes), but the e2e probe fixture lacks a matching comment explaining the choice.","Two pre-existing test failures in tank_data::presets (from unstaged tanksim-6e5.7.2 param_meta changes) are unrelated to this deliverable."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Minor: Add a brief comment to breeding_success_state (lines 379-380) explaining why DOC/DON use absolute values rather than `* vol`, matching the existing comment in reproduction_factors.rs:34 ('Keep DOC/DON low to avoid transient ammonia spike from mineralization')."],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"4a472069-4b64-4213-9086-4372f60ef96d"}
